        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12925.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7aed5401ea04060a0268739bedfaaf7c65424111659c0c9903cb26b80c8b41a9",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-08-31/pdf/FR-1994-08-31.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Section 1. Establishm ent o f Emergency Board  (“Board”) .  There is established, \neffective August 29, 1994, a Board of three members to be appointed by \nthe President to investigate this dispute. No member shall be pecuniarily \nor otherwise interested in any organization of railroad employees or any \nrailroad carrier. The Board shall perform its functions subject to the availabil­\nity of funds*"
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2023,
      "char_start": 1906,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12925#sec2",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 2.",
      "pdf_page": 303,
      "scope_id": "EO:12925#sec2",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 45181, PDF pages 303-303",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "edd74cb28a2122ba6e5cb718c04343ff44e93ab55aff3d5c7d74c8d86d6b7958",
        "signing_date": "1994-08-29",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12925.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7aed5401ea04060a0268739bedfaaf7c65424111659c0c9903cb26b80c8b41a9",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-08-31/pdf/FR-1994-08-31.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 2. Report.  The Board shall report to the President with respect to \nthe dispute within 30 days of its creation."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2583,
      "char_start": 2024,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12925#sec3",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 3.",
      "pdf_page": 303,
      "scope_id": "EO:12925#sec3",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
        "page_or_item": "59 FR 45181, PDF pages 303-303",
        "requires_page_check": false,
        "sha256": "edd74cb28a2122ba6e5cb718c04343ff44e93ab55aff3d5c7d74c8d86d6b7958",
        "signing_date": "1994-08-29",
        "text_path": "jobs/fr-originals/data/full_run/texts/EO_12925.txt",
        "text_sha256": "7aed5401ea04060a0268739bedfaaf7c65424111659c0c9903cb26b80c8b41a9",
        "url": "https://www.govinfo.gov/content/pkg/FR-1994-08-31/pdf/FR-1994-08-31.pdf"
      },
      "text": "Sec. 3. M aintaining Conditions.  As provided by section 10 of the Act, from \nthe date of the creation of the Board and for 30 days after the Board \nhas submitted its report to the President, no change in the conditions out \nof which the dispute arose shall be made by the parties to the controversy, \nexcept by agreement of the parties.\nSec, 4. Records M aintenance.  The records and files of the Board are records \nof the Office of the President and upon the Board’ s termination shall be \nmaintained in the physical custody of the National Mediation Board."
    },
    {
      "char_end": 2782,
      "char_start": 2584,
      "id": "CLAUSES:EO:12925#sec5",
      "kind": "section",
      "label": "Sec. 5.",
      "pdf_page": 303,
      "scope_id": "EO:12925#sec5",
      "source": {
        "filing_date": null,
        "location_confidence": "high",
        "location_verified": false,
